Lucide is a fork of Feather Icons (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2013-present
Cole Bemis). Per lucide-static's own LICENSE file, a number of icons are
still listed as derived from Feather and carry that MIT notice alongside
Lucide's ISC grant. Of the icons vendored in this directory, the following
source lucide names appear on that Feather-derived list: check,
chevron-down, code, download, maximize, minimize-2, minus, plus, square.
The remaining vendored icons (columns-2, copy, eye, film, folder-open,
grid-2x2, picture-in-picture-2, pipette, rows-2, scan, share-2, shuffle)
are Lucide-original, under ISC only.

Geometry in this directory has been rescaled from Lucide's 24px grid /
2px stroke to a 16px grid / 1.5px stroke for Sombra's design system
(see scripts/generate-icons.ts and scripts/lib/normalize-icon.ts). Only
path/shape geometry is retained; no code, class names, or build tooling
from the lucide packages ship in the app bundle. Original copyright is
retained by the Lucide contributors and, for the icons named above, the
Feather Icons contributors.

Source mapping (owned name -> lucide-static icon) is tracked in
src/icons/icon-manifest.json.
